abstract: >-
  A foundational preprint proposing a typed audit calculus for claims that
  move between scientific descriptions. The release contains the paper,
  editable source, a two-page synopsis, audit ledgers, eight exact mathematical
  fixtures, and one deterministic execution receipt. Paper and human-readable
  documentation are CC BY 4.0; code, workflows, JSON Schema, and
  machine-readable fixture tooling are MIT licensed according to the repository
  license map.
